Subject: EVO-X2 Scratch Build Preflight Refusal Observation Gap

@ [fault_uuid] ea25119f-37f8-4748-a28f-dfb1535933ad
@ [canonical_uuid] 935e020f-8c6f-49e4-b355-63eabd3b778b

& [Observed]
  + receipt20 always contains toolchain_observation11 while ESBE-021 requires an honest stopped refusal before toolchain observation when an earlier preflight gate fails
  + the published local core admitted only a successful available_without_mutation observation, so it could not encode a truthful pre-observation refusal

& [Correction]
  + define one exact all-fields-present sentinel with not_observed text, SHA256-empty digests, and offline_probe_status not_observed_due_to_preflight_refusal
  + allow the sentinel only for failed or refused receipts and continue to require available_without_mutation for succeeded receipts and every Cargo operation
  + the sentinel conveys no toolchain identity and grants no execution authority

& [Status]
  + corrected locally with focused refusal coverage pending full gates and publication
